     "text": "Assuming **one adult, one-way**, Alaska Airlines’ page currently advertises **from $391 USD in Saver economy** for **Seattle (SEA) → Anchorage (ANC), Saturday, November 14, 2026**. Saver is its most restrictive, no-frills fare option. ([alaskaair.com](https://www.alaskaair.com/en/flights-from-seattle-to-anchorage))\n\n**Where to book:** [Alaska Airlines’ Seattle–Anchorage booking page](https://www.alaskaair.com/en/flights-from-seattle-to-anchorage). Select **one-way**, **November 14, 2026**, and **Saver**, and decline optional extras.\n\n**Price caveat:** This is an advertised fare, not a confirmed checkout quote. Alaska says displayed prices were available within the past 24 hours and may change or sell out; optional baggage and other services cost extra. ([alaskaair.com](https://www.alaskaair.com/en/flights-from-seattle-to-anchorage))\n\nSOURCES: AlaskaAir.com",
